  "description": "Polaris ingestion v1: accept/reject rate, reject reason breakdown, deprecated-schema usage, dedupe behaviour, origin and rate-limit drops, and pattern-based redaction counts. Panels reference `polaris_ingest_*` metrics defined in apps/ingester-api/src/metrics/registry.ts. Known gaps are listed in the 'About' panel.",
