      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Polaris Ingestion\n\nMetrics from `apps/ingester-api/src/metrics/registry.ts`, exposed at the ingester `/metrics` endpoint and scraped by Prometheus (job `polaris-ingester`).\n\n**Reject reasons** are the closed set from `packages/shared-schemas/src/reason-codes.ts`:\n\n- `unsupported_schema_version`, `schema_version_sunset`, `unknown_event`, `invalid_properties`, `invalid_envelope` \u2014 schema family\n- `forbidden_field_rejected` \u2014 forbidden-field policy reject tier\n- `duplicate` \u2014 short-window dedupe hit (event is _not_ counted as accepted)\n- `publish_failed` \u2014 accepted but RabbitMQ publish failed; see also `polaris_ingest_publish_failed_total` (MKEF1I9G) for the per-topic counter\n- `invalid_request` \u2014 malformed batch envelope\n\n**Accept-latency panel** uses `polaris_ingest_accept_duration_seconds` histogram (CSH8YAL6). The corresponding `_ms_last` gauge is intentionally retained during the transition for legacy panels; v2 dashboards consume the histogram directly via `histogram_quantile(...)`.\n\n**Body size histogram** is still a gap and tracked separately.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(polaris_ingest_batch_accepted_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "accepted",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(polaris_ingest_batch_rejected_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Accept vs reject rate (5m, ops)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
